{'symbol': 'WEC', 'date': '2021-12-14 08:00:00', 'title': "WEC ENERGY GROUP'S JAYHAWK WIND FARM GOES INTO SERVICE", 'text': 'MILWAUKEE, DEC. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WEC ENERGY GROUP (NYSE: WEC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE 190-MEGAWATT JAYHAWK WIND FARM IN BOURBON AND CRAWFORD COUNTIES, KANSAS, HAS ACHIEVED COMMERCIAL OPERATION. JAYHAWK IS GENERATING RENEWABLE ENERGY THAT IS BEING SOLD UNDER LONG-TERM CONTRACT TO META, FORMERLY THE FACEBOOK COMPANY.'}